{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%}
  One /search grid card for this product, exactly as the search page prints it (PRICE-COMPARE.md): "Inspirerad av"
  line and designer bottle, the L'Oréal houses the search page's masked label (pm_frag_role 'search').
  Loaded by assets/pm-frag-search-related.js as /products/<handle>?view=pm-search-card: on a designer perfume
  search the results page lists pmFrag.detect()'s scents (other close matches + our scents of the hero's scent
  family) under "Fler i samma doftfamilj", and the ones not in the Shopify results come from here.
  Card settings = the search page's (templates/search.json, section "main"); keep them in step if those change.
{%- endcomment -%}
<li class="grid__item" data-pm-pid="{{ product.id }}">
  {% render 'card-product'
    , card_product: product
    , media_aspect_ratio: 'adapt'
    , image_shape: 'default'
    , show_secondary_image: false
    , show_vendor: false
    , show_rating: true
    , lazy_load: true
    , skip_styles: true
    , pm_frag_role: 'search'
  %}
</li>
